  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"477\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-photo-15105872-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5732\" style=\"width:475px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-photo-15105872-1.webp 683w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-photo-15105872-1-300x210.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم، الحمد لله رب العالمين والصلاة والسلام على سيدنا محمد وعلى آله وصحبه أجمعين. أما بعد</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نحمد الله تعالى الذي وفقنا لخدمة كتابه العزيز، ونسأله أن يتقبل منا ويجعله في ميزان حسناتنا. يسرنا أن نقدم لكم تحميل المصحف كامل مكتوب بخط كبير بدون نت pdf ، حيث يمكنكم الآن الاستفادة من نسخة عالية الجودة بتقسيم السور في صيغة PDF.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">PDF تستطيعون أيضاً تحميل المصحف كامل بصيغة Word (doc)، المعدة بعناية من قبل مجمع الملك فهد لطباعة المصحف الشريف. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>من خلال الرابط أدناه</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">quran book pdf</h4>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">المصحف برواية حفص عن عاصم مرفق بالخط حفص</pre>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\">حجم الملف : 603 كيلو بايت -&nbsp; نسخة مكتوبة وورد بصيغة duc.</pre>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://archive.org/download/Quran_Hafs-L/Quran_Hafs_L.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5730\" style=\"width:98px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1.png 256w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\" /></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://archive.org/download/sunnahandhadith/UthmanicHafs1-Ex1-Ver12-browser.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1ZIP.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5729\" style=\"width:109px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1ZIP.jpeg 225w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1ZIP-150x150.jpeg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Download pdf al quran english</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Translations of the Qur’an | Surahs of the Holy Qur’an The Holy Qur’an in English pdf (Translation of the meanings of the Holy Qur’an in English &#8211; The best translation of the quran book pdf<br>Translating the meanings of the Qur’an into English</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://dn790006.ca.archive.org/0/items/UploadWay2sona_20161017/The%20Holy%20Quran%20Translation%20By%20Hilali%20and%20Khan.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5735\" style=\"width:114px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png 256w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Download the entire Qur’an in English mp3</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-rounded\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://archive.org/compress/AlQuranWithEnglishSaheehIntlTranslation--RecitationByMishariIbnRashidAl-AfasyWithIbrahimWalk/formats=VBR%20MP3&amp;file=/AlQuranWithEnglishSaheehIntlTranslation--RecitationByMishariIbnRashidAl-AfasyWithIbrahimWalk.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5736\" style=\"width:165px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1.jpeg 225w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/images-1-150x150.jpeg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\"> يمكنك أيضا تحميل المصاحف التالية</h4>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><a href=\"https://quranbook.org/quran-karim/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Quran karim</a></strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://quranvoice.org/%d8%aa%d8%ad%d9%85%d9%8a%d9%84-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%b5%d8%ad%d9%81-%d9%83%d8%a7%d9%85%d9%84-%d9%85%d9%83%d8%aa%d9%88%d8%a8-%d8%a8%d8%ae%d8%b7-%d9%83%d8%a8%d9%8a%d8%b1-pdf/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">مصحف المدينة المنورة باللون الأزرق pdf</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://quranvoice.org/%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%b5%d8%ad%d9%81-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b4%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%81-pdf/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">مصحف المدينة المنورة باللون الأخضر pdf</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://archive.org/download/arabic-568335686835685363568q3an1/arabic-quran2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">مصحف المدينة المنورة الجواميعي الكبير الأزرق pdf</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://quranvoice.org/%d8%aa%d8%ad%d9%85%d9%8a%d9%84-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%82%d8%b1%d8%a2%d9%86-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%83%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%85-pdf/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">تحميل القرآن الكريم pdf</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://surahquran.com/quran-tafseer-aljalalean.html\">ا</a><a href=\"https://quranvoice.org/%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%82%d8%b1%d8%a2%d9%86-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%83%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%85-%d9%85%d8%b5%d8%ad%d9%81-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%aa%d8%ac%d9%88%d9%8a%d8%af-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d9%84%d9%88%d9%86-%d9%88-%d8%a8%d9%87/\">لقرآن الكريم و بهامشه تفسير الجلالين pdf</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://ia800601.us.archive.org/10/items/EQuran00003/E-Quran-00003.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">القرآن الكريم pdf للموبايل pdf</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
